{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DOTS Survivors is a casual action game where you play as an astronaut exploring the cosmos fending off hostile aliens along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your ideal character build from two dozen unique weapons and powerups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326810/extras/Attacks-2.png?t=1744148691\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weapons to choose:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oxygen Hose Whip</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rogue Jetpack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Radioactive Waste Drops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drone Swarm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mega Laser Strike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Screwdriver Shot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sawblade Scatter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Satellite Dish Toss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CO2 Vent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plasma Blaster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Black Hole</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">O.M.G. Wrench</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade your capabilities to defeat more aliens!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326810/extras/LevelUpScreen.png?t=1744148691\" /><strong>Fight off waves of alien foes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326810/extras/Aliens.png?t=1744148691\" /><strong>Discover more hostile aliens!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326810/extras/Bestiary.png?t=1744148691\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This project serves